  "title": "Grilled Mediterranean Vegetable Sandwich",
  "description": "This is a delicious recipe for a focaccia sandwich with roasted eggplant and red bell peppers and sautéed portobello mushrooms. You can also grill the vegetables, or substitute other favorite veggies or Italian flatbread of your choice.",
  "authors": [
    "CHRIS M"
  ],
